WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.950
I walked dogs for a living.

2
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.160
At Starbucks, I ordered coffee with a little spice.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.050
It knew my name.

4
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.885
Then it asked for my password.

5
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.410
An AI in a paper cup.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.910
I wanted caffeine. It wanted...

7
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.490
the end of the world.
